@startuml STM-8
!include _style.iuml
title STM-8 (System level) — Status of an RfidCard\nrfid_cards.status · v1.0 · 01/11/2026

[*] --> unlinked
note left of unlinked
  created when the Admin registers
  a card (UC-ADM-04); kind online,
  wallet or free_vend
end note
unlinked --> active : Admin links it\nto a Driver
active --> unlinked : Admin unlinks it
active --> blocked : Admin blocks it\n(lost or misused)
blocked --> active : Admin unblocks it
blocked --> [*] : Admin retires it
note right of active
  Only active cards are accepted at the
  Charge Point. A session started offline
  with an unlinked or blocked card is still
  recorded, as unattributed (AD-6).
end note
@enduml
